# The dispatch contract of UltraDim's centroid update (A7), from qdrant
# lib/projection-voting-kmeans/src/gpu_kmeans.rs update_centroids_gpu
# (1457-1528): ONE dispatch of ceil(k * d / 256) x 1 x 1 workgroups (here
# ceil(k * d / wg_x)) with params = (n_vectors, n_centroids, dimensions, 0).
# The bounds are this problem's cases' (problems/kmeans_update/cases): n up to
# 1,048,576, k up to 1,024, d up to 4,096, k * d up to 1,048,576 cells, so at
# a workgroup of 16 or more invocations the dispatch is at most 65,535
# workgroups along x. The work guard bounds A7's loop over the points by
# params.x.
workgroups x 1 65535
workgroups y 1 1
workgroups z 1 1
param params.x 1 1048576
param params.y 1 1024
param params.z 1 4096
param params.w 0 0
